236
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:58,000
Û çira ba, piştî çirê, kehrebe hat.
 
And it was a lamp, after the lamp, electricity came.

237
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Diçûn ji kuderê derdixistin?
 
