267
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Ez û bavikê xwe ne, îşte...
 
It is me and my father, so...

268
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Her carê yek?
 
One each time?

269
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:24,000
Ew ne kure, îşte ew hawa dikin.
 
It's not deep, we do it like this.

270
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,000
Temam spas tera ji.
 
Okay, thank you too.

271
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Sax bî.
 
Be healthy.

